    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omukyeno gwa Isirairi habw'okuramya ebisisani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu afa, baitu eki, busaho n'omu akiteekereza; abantu abanyakwemarra ha diini, batwarwa, baitu eki busaho n'omu akyetegereza. Habwokuba omuntu omurungi atwarwa aruga omu muhito, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ataaha omu businge, abo abanyakukora ebirungi, omukufa basangamu obusinge n'ekihuumuro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu inywe batabani b'omukazi omufumu, oruzaaro rw'omusaija omusiihani n'orw'omukazi malaaya mwirre haihi hanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimusekeereza oha? Inywe embiihi z'ebisuba, nimugaaniiza oha? Timuli baana b'obubi, timuli ruzaaro rw'obucwangya? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe abarukwenda kusiihanira omumiti y'emivule, hansi y'omuti gwona ogujumbire; inywe abarukwitira abaana banyu omubihanga; omu myatika z'emyandara? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mabaale agarukuterra ag'omu kihanga, nugwo omugabo gwanyu amabaale ago, amabaale ago nugwo omugabo gwanyu; nugwo mwahongiire ekihongwa eky'ekyokunywa, nugwo mwahongiire ekihongwa eky'ebyokulya. Baitu nyowe ebi nibimpuumuza? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha rusozi orw'ekitiinisa kandi oruraihire, nuho wataire ekitabu kyawe, kandi oku, nuho wagendaga kuhonga ekyonzira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyuma y'orwigi n'omukumirro, nuho wataire emmanyiikirizo yawe; habwokuba, obu walekere nyowe, okasurra ekitabu kyawe, wakitemba, okakigalihya; okakora endagaano n'abo bakama b'ekitabu eki ogonza orozere ha njuro yaabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyemiisira ebirukuboya, oyesiiga amagita, nukwo ogenda kuramya embandwa Moleeki. Okazoora abacwezi ab'okuramya, otuma abakwenda omu bicweka ebya hara, noobwakubaire nyabuyonga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noobu oliba wagenzire orugendo orukooto orwakujwahize, baitu otagambe oti: Ninjwahira busa; okatunga ekintu ekihyaka eky'okukugarramu amaani, nukwo kutagwa ensazi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biraha ebi ebirukukutiinisa nukwo okambiiha ebisuba, okaleka kunyijuka, okaleka kunteekerezaho? Ntaculeere omwanya mukooto muno, eki nikyo kirukukutanga kuntiina? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nooteekereza ngu ebyokora bihikire, baitu ninyija kuranga engeso zawe, kandi embandwa zaawe zoona tizasobole kukukoonyera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu oraateeraga enduuru, embandwa zaawe ezi wasoroize nyamwingi, ezi, zikujunege turole! Omuyaga guliziihaho, orwoya orw'akanwa rulizitwara hara. Baitu omuntu anyakunyebinga, alirya ensi, kandi aligweterwa orusozi rwange orurukwera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA aliragira ati: Mulime, mulime kandi musemeze mumarre kimu enkonge zoona omu muhanda gw'abantu bange.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba, ogu ow'ekitiinisa kandi owa haiguru, ayabaireho buli na buli, anyakwetwa Omuhikiriire, naagamba ati: Nyikara omu kiikaro ekya haiguru kandi ekirukwera, kandi nyikara n'omuntu ow'anyakwina omutima ogurukweteera kandi ogurukwebundaaza, nukwo ngumye ogu arukwebundaaza, ngumye ogu ow'omutima ogurukweteera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba, tindiikara ninteera empaka ebiro byona, kandi tindiikara mbiihirwe kakuba nkora eki, abantu balindugaho, kandi kunu ninyowe nabahangire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkamubiihirirwa habw'obubi obunyakuleetwa omu kwegombakwe, nukwo kumufubira nayesereka habw'okukwatwa ekiniga; baitu akeyongera kugumira omu bubi bwe, naahondera ebiteekerezo eby'omutima gwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mboine engesoze, kandi ninyija kumutambira, ninyija kumwebembera kandi ndimusumbuusa obusinge, mbusumbuuse n'abo abarukurra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.2.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bef 2:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba hara n'abahaihi, ndibasumbuusa obusinge, kandi ndimukoonyera; MUKAMA nukwo arukugamba ati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu ababi nibasisana nk'enyanja erukusikuka, etarukusobora kuteekaana; amaizi gaayo, gaimukya esaabu n'oburofu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 57:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.48.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 48:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga wange naagamba ati:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.57.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.57.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
